#uuid "ea643c40-ecff-588f-a522-a8fae6a91314" 13194139535216 true] [17592186338044 1034 "s\\ge -3" 13194139535216 true] [17592186338044 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535216 true] [17592186338044 1111 #uuid "93777995-9014-55b6-a4b3-5949842b771b" 13194139535216 true] [17592186338045 1017 #edb/ref 17592186338046 13194139535216 true] [17592186338045 1017 #edb/ref 17592186338052 13194139535216 true] [17592186338045 1089 "q-341137" 13194139535216 true] [17592186338045 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535216 true] [17592186338045 1100 "Use the Laplace transform of $f(t)={e}^{\\text{i}\\omega t}$ to find the Laplace transform of $\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5t).$$\\,L{\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5t)}=$ {{field-1}},\ndefined for {{field-2}}." 13194139535216 true] [17592186338045 1113 #uuid "81b1c410-ca7f-529a-81f8-133edb7ade0b" 13194139535216 true] [17592186338045 1145 "The linearity property of the Laplace transform states that for functions $f(t)$ and $g(t),$ we have\n\n$$\nL{\\alpha f(t)+\\beta g(t)}=\\alpha \\cdot L{f(t)}+\\beta \\cdot L{g(t)},\n$$\n\nwhere $\\alpha $ and $\\beta $ are constants.\n\nFirst, recall that the cosine function can be defined in terms of complex exponentials as follows: \n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5t)=\\frac{{e}^{5\\text{i}t}+{e}^{-5\\text{i}t}}{2}\n$$\n\nTaking the Laplace transform and applying the linearity property, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L{\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5t)} & =L{\\frac{{e}^{5\\text{i}t}+{e}^{-5\\text{i}t}}{2}} \\\\  & =L{\\frac{{e}^{5\\text{i}t}}{2}+\\frac{{e}^{-5\\text{i}t}}{2}} \\\\  & =L{\\frac{{e}^{5\\text{i}t}}{2}}+L{\\frac{{e}^{-5\\text{i}t}}{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}L{{e}^{5\\text{i}t}}+\\frac{1}{2}L{{e}^{-5\\text{i}t}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we recall that \n\n$$\nL{{e}^{\\text{i}\\omega t}}=\\frac{1}{s-\\text{i}\\omega },\\,s>0.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L{{e}^{5\\text{i}t}} & =\\frac{1}{s-5\\text{i}},\\,s>0 \\\\ L{{e}^{-5\\text{i}t}} & =\\frac{1}{s+5\\text{i}},\\,s>0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the Laplace transform of $\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5t)$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L{\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5t)} & =\\frac{1}{2}L{{e}^{5\\text{i}t}}+\\frac{1}{2}L{{e}^{-5\\text{i}t}} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot \\frac{1}{s-5\\text{i}}+\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot \\frac{1}{s+5\\text{i}} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}(\\frac{1}{s-5\\text{i}}+\\frac{1}{s+5\\text{i}}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}(\\frac{(s+5\\text{i})+(s-5\\text{i})}{(s-5\\text{i})(s+5\\text{i})}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}(\\frac{2s}{{s}^{2}+25}) \\\\  & =\\frac{s}{{s}^{2}+25},\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\ndefined for $s>0.$" 13194139535216 true] [17592186338046 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338047 13194139535216 true] [17592186338046 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338048 13194139535216 true] [17592186338046 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338049 13194139535216 true] [17592186338046 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338050 13194139535216 true] [17592186338046 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338051 13194139535216 true] [17592186338046 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045451 13194139535216 true] [17592186338046 1041 "field-1" 13194139535216 true] [17592186338046 1104 #edb/ref 17592186338047 13194139535216 true] [17592186338046 1110 #uuid "06b49f43-2c2c-5bf5-a295-ac9a81108243" 13194139535216 true] [17592186338047 1034 "\\frac{s}{{s}^{2}+25}" 13194139535216 true] [17592186338047 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535216 true] [17592186338047 1111 #uuid "5604f237-d4f6-556b-b420-7ced80e5606e" 13194139535216 true] [17592186338048 1034 "\\frac{s}{{s}^{2}-25}" 13194139535216 true] [17592186338048 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535216 true] [17592186338048 1111 #uuid "9f825f7b-e269-5476-b7b2-2576efc6012f" 13194139535216 true] [17592186338049 1034 "\\frac{5}{{s}^{2}-25}" 13194139535216 true] [17592186338049 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535216 true] [17592186338049 1111 #uuid "ad822efe-34a3-57a6-80e3-30081ce83138" 13194139535216 true] [17592186338050 1034 "\\frac{5s}{{s}^{2}+25}" 13194139535216 true] [17592186338050 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535216 true] [17592186338